这不是特别好笑，但是这些人一夜没睡。

00:50:23.260 --> 00:50:26.260
Bogs and Russell are practically crying.
博格斯和拉塞尔几乎哭了。

00:50:26.260 --> 00:50:30.579
Oh God, why are we laughing at this?
天哪，我们为什么要笑这个？

00:50:30.579 --> 00:50:33.980
It's where a bunch of fucking retards.
这里就是一群该死的弱智的地方。

00:50:33.980 --> 00:50:39.099
And all of a sudden Cliff punches Russell in the face hard, breaking his nose.
突然，克里夫狠狠地打了拉塞尔的脸，打断了他的鼻子。

00:50:39.099 --> 00:50:40.900
Russell falls to the floor.
拉塞尔摔倒在地。

00:50:40.900 --> 00:50:42.820
The laughter dies quickly.
笑声很快就消失了。

00:50:42.820 --> 00:50:44.579
Russell looks up stunned.
拉塞尔惊愕地抬起头。

00:50:44.579 --> 00:50:46.420
Nobody can believe what just happened.
没有人相信刚刚发生的事情。

00:50:46.420 --> 00:50:50.179
Least of all Cliff, there's a long beat of silence.
最重要的是克里夫，有一段长时间的沉默。

00:50:50.179 --> 00:50:54.179
And we hard cut to the Pendleton living room, the actual show.
我们硬切到彭德尔顿的客厅，真正的表演。

00:50:54.179 --> 00:50:58.730
The live studio audience watches the Christmas scene.
现场演播室观众观看圣诞节场景。

00:50:58.730 --> 00:51:02.409
Mr. P, what treat do you think Santa wants?
P先生，你认为圣诞老人想要什么礼物？

00:51:02.409 --> 00:51:04.210
Oh, nothing much.
哦，没什么。

00:51:04.210 --> 00:51:06.409
Just a Porsche 944.
只是一辆保时捷 944。

00:51:06.409 --> 00:51:09.409
Huge laugh, the audience eats it up.
笑点大，观众都吃得津津有味。

00:51:09.409 --> 00:51:13.449
In the darkness at the edge of the stage, Cliff watches by himself.
在舞台边缘的黑暗中，克里夫独自观看。

00:51:13.449 --> 00:51:20.809
The writers, Dave, Bog, Sarah, Russell, with his nose bandaged and Jimmy, stand closer, listening to the laughter.
编剧们，戴夫、博格、莎拉、拉塞尔，鼻子上缠着绷带，吉米则站得更近，听着笑声。

00:51:20.809 --> 00:51:23.289
Jimmy Smiles, satisfied.
吉米满意地微笑。

00:51:23.289 --> 00:51:33.340
It got a laugh.
它得到了笑声。

00:51:33.340 --> 00:51:34.780
All right, there you have it.
好吧，给你了。

00:51:34.780 --> 00:51:38.260
Gimme five, so funny, so moving.
给我五，太有趣了，太感人了。

00:51:39.219 --> 00:51:42.619
Just a really incredible piece of work.
这真是一件令人难以置信的作品。

00:51:42.619 --> 00:51:52.780
And that would just be sitting on the cloud or in hard drives, Carter and Craig's hard drives, if it was not for dead pilot society.
如果不是死亡飞行员社会，这些数据只会存在于云端或硬盘中，卡特和克雷格的硬盘中。

00:51:52.780 --> 00:52:08.019
I think that's something that's worth supporting that we get these shows, we bring them to life, we make them available for you to listen to, the writers get to hear their work, no one else is doing this.
我认为这是值得支持的事情，我们得到这些节目，我们将它们带入生活，我们让它们可供您收听，编剧们可以听到他们的作品，没有其他人在这样做。

00:52:08.019 --> 00:52:27.179
I hope you, you're motivated to become a part of the Dead Pilots Society by going to maximumfund.org slash join Dead Pilots and becoming a member, or if you're already a member, Think about boosting or upgrading.
我希望您有动力成为死亡飞行员协会的一员，通过访问maximumfund.org 加入死亡飞行员协会并成为会员，或者如果您已经是会员，请考虑提升或升级。

00:52:27.179 --> 00:52:33.340
We've got a great year of pilots we're gonna be bringing you and we'd love for your support as a member.
我们将给您带来美好的一年的试点，我们希望您作为会员给予支持。

00:52:33.340 --> 00:52:35.059
All right, thanks so much.
好的，非常感谢。

00:52:35.059 --> 00:52:49.860
We'll be back with a lot more this week, including the second half of my interview with Carter and Craig and more of our countdown of the top five funniest cold opens in dead pilot society history.
本周我们将带来更多内容，包括我对卡特和克雷格采访的后半部分，以及更多关于死亡飞行员社会历史上最有趣的前五名冷开场的倒计时。

00:52:49.860 --> 00:52:54.059
Okay, you'll be hearing more from me very soon, but thanks so much for listening.
好的，您很快就会收到我的更多消息，但非常感谢您的聆听。

00:52:54.059 --> 00:52:55.860
I'm Andrew Reich.
我是安德鲁·赖克。

00:52:55.860 --> 00:52:57.260
Until next time, take care.
直到下次，保重。

